  "notes": "USAGE: Japan is one of the most volcanically active countries, with over 100 active volcanoes.\n\nTYPES:\n- ⟦{活火山|かつかざん}→活火山：15901_kakkazan⟧ (active volcano)\n- ⟦{休火山|きゅうかざん}→休火山：28330_kyuukazan⟧ (dormant volcano)\n- ⟦{死火山|しかざん}→死火山：28367_shikazan⟧ (extinct volcano)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{噴火|ふんか}→噴火：00045_funka⟧ (eruption)\n- ⟦{溶岩|ようがん}→溶岩：13328_yougan⟧ (lava)\n- ⟦{火口|かこう}→火口：00448_kakou⟧ (crater)\n- ⟦{火山灰|かざんばい}→火山灰：19412_kazanbai⟧ (volcanic ash)\n- ⟦{温泉|おんせん}→温泉：04117_onsen⟧ (hot spring - often found near volcanoes)\n\nFAMOUS JAPANESE VOLCANOES: ⟦{富士山|ふじさん}→富士山：09514_fujisan⟧, ⟦{桜島|さくらじま}→桜島：noentry⟧, ⟦{阿蘇山|あそさん}→阿蘇山：noentry⟧",
